#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/intrinsics/layout/mma_sm100_layout/index.rst:140
msgid "Each 2SM instruction reads an N/2 shard of B from each CTA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/intrinsics/layout/mma_sm100_layout/index.rst:147
msgid ""
"``atom_m`` is the per-CTA M extent.  The 1SM M64 atom is PTX Layout F (half "
"datapaths, 32-datapath halves interleaved); the 2SM atoms fold the peer "
"CTA's N shard into the upper datapaths (PTX Layouts A/B/C)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/intrinsics/layout/mma_sm100_layout/index.rst:156
msgid ""
"``.ws`` instructions with M below 128 fold N shards into the upper datapaths "
"instead of leaving them idle: PTX Layout E for M64 and Layout G for M32."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/intrinsics/layout/mma_sm100_layout/index.rst:175
msgid ""
"Ordinary SS accumulators use the interleaved allocation; dense TS traits pin "
"CUTLASS's NonInterleaved (1SM) / Interleaved (2SM) modes; ``.ws`` SS "
"instructions use the weight-stationary fragment (PTX Layouts E/G)."
msgstr ""
